Package: profylr
Title: Latent Profiles, Classes, and Transitions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("David", "S. Cassell", email = "davidscassell@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits latent profile, latent class, and latent transition models.
    Release 1 estimates a first-order Markov model with a shared C++ core.
    Indicators may be Gaussian, Bernoulli, nominal, or a conditionally
    independent product of one Gaussian block and categorical items.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Copyright: see inst/COPYRIGHTS
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: Rcpp, tibble, rlang, generics, ggplot2
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), lavaan, semTools
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/davidscassell/profylr
BugReports: https://github.com/davidscassell/profylr/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.3.0
SystemRequirements: C++17
NeedsCompilation: yes
